1
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,160
Li Yiying.

2
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,879
We've already finalized our divorce.

3
00:01:04,879 --> 00:01:07,340
There's no need for this couple photoshoot.

4
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:09,440
Don't think you can salvage

5
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,039
our relationship like this.

6
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:12,520
I can't let down

7
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,380
Qianqian's true feelings for me.

8
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,760
Yes, I admit

9
00:01:17,039 --> 00:01:18,240
I wronged you before.

10
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:21,480
But didn't I also give you such a big house

11
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,600
to run a B&B?

12
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,120
But to be honest,

13
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,280
I used to always think

14
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,080
you didn't care about me,

15
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:30,940
and were only with me for my money.

16
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:34,200
I didn't expect that now we're really separated,

17
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,200
you'd be this sad.

18
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,600
Seeing you so upset,

19
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:40,000
I actually feel a bit...

20
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,800
What's wrong?

21
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:49,570
Is your heart acting up?

22
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,200
Did Lili make you mad?

23
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,360
You made me mad.

24
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:55,360
And her name is Qianqian.

25
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:59,000
You didn't hear what I just said, did you?

26
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,160
Can we just not take the photos?

27
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:02,160
No, I've already paid the deposit.

28
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,280
Got it?

29
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:06,880
It's inappropriate for us to take couple photos with our current relationship.

30
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:07,560
Got it?

31
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,000
What are you thinking?

32
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,400
I changed it a long time ago.

33
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:12,200
I'm shooting with my best friend's dog.

34
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:12,880
Dog?

35
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,520
It's inconvenient to take a taxi with a pet.

36
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,180
So I asked you to be the driver.

37
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,579
I'll be the driver.

38
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,560
And you shoot with the dog.

39
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,720
Not with me, right?

40
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,160
You are quite interesting.

41
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,160
You said it yourself.

42
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:27,079
It's inappropriate for us to shoot together.

43
00:02:27,079 --> 00:02:27,800
It's unfair to me,

44
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,160
and let Shasha down.

45
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:29,960
Qianqian.

46
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:34,020
So you heard everything I just said, didn't you?

47
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:35,920
Hurry up and pack.

48
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,760
I have things to do after dropping you off.

49
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,440
Don't make any plans after 7:00 PM.

50
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,040
Why?

51
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,760
You have to pick me up.

52
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,160
You...

53
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:48,720
Miss Li.

54
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:51,840
Mr. Zhang.

55
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:53,579
I want to make this part

56
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:54,680
green.

57
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:56,300
No problem.

58
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:02,720
Here, take a look.

59
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,320
That'll be 99.

60
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:08,800
WeChat or Alipay?

61
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,840
99.

62
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,900
That's enough to buy hair dye.

63
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:16,120
Miss Li.

64
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,000
I'll print a sample first

65
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,820
for you to check the photo.

66
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,200
If there's no problem,

67
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,440
I'll print the rest of

68
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,600
the photos for you.

69
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:26,200
Then this order will be officially completed.

70
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:29,320
Hello.

71
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,520
Hello.

72
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,360
Did you tell Mom about my work?

73
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:35,600
I just told the truth.

74
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,560
Do you have a job?

75
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:42,800
With my abilities,

76
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,120
it's just a matter of minutes.

77
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,250
I won't condescend.

78
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,680
Fine. Don't ask me for money then.

79
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,480
I'm sorry, Miss Li.

80
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,600
The photos I just edited for you,

81
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,760
I haven't had time to save them to the computer.

82
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,560
As for the printer,

83
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,690
because the photo paper didn't match,

84
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,640
it automatically short-circuited.

85
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:05,320
It's fine. Just print another one.

86
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,850
The computer is broken too.

87
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,650
All the photos taken for you

88
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,120
were automatically cleared.

89
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:13,680
Are you saying

90
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:15,600
my hard work all day

91
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,730
was all for nothing?

92
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,300
Please don't be angry yet.

93
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:21,500
How about this?

94
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,450
I'll shoot another set for you.

95
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,040
No.

96
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,920
You have to pay up.

97
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,600
How should I compensate?

98
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:35,020
Triple compensation,

99
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,920
plus a free portrait set.

100
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:37,760
No,

101
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:39,480
aren't you just ripping me off?

102
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,409
I'm just running a small business.

103
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:44,480
Miss Li, you are beautiful and kind,

104
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,000
understanding,

105
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,800
and spirited.

106
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,280
How could you be so cruel?

107
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,900
How about this?

108
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:52,320
You work as my receptionist for a month,

109
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:53,580
and we'll call it even.

110
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,240
I can even provide free room and board.

111
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:55,920
How about it?

112
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,050
This is impossible.

113
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:03,840
Since I rightfully claimed compensation last week

114
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:06,240
and was insulted by your customer service,

115
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:09,920
I've decided to sue for 2,000 yuan in emotional distress.

116
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,160
Dear,

117
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,840
the customer service rep Lihuamao who helped you before

118
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:16,100
has already resigned.

119
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:18,160
In addition, dear, your request for the store

120
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,820
to pay all compensation items

121
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,040
is unreasonable.

122
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,080
It failed to pass the review.

123
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,930
Please give me a tissue.

124
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,040
I'm sorry.

125
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,640
I mean tissue.

126
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,280
I've been in a cosmopolitan city for so long

127
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:44,340
that I'm used to it.

128
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:45,800
Pretentious.

129
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,720
Are you insulting me?

130
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,159
I'm sorry.

131
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,600
It's a habit of mine.

132
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,320
Tissue, thank you.

133
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,770
What does this mean?

134
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,280
This is a special edition tissue

135
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:05,600
provided by our store

136
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,080
for our cosmopolitan guests.

137
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,400
It only costs three yuan.

138
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,200
Do you want it?

139
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:15,720
All right.

140
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:23,680
I paid for the whole pack.

141
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,760
Miss, three yuan

142
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,240
is the price for one piece.

143
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:30,000
A whole pack should be at least thirty.

144
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,760
Just you wait.

145
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,600
Sure, I'll wait.

146
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,040
If that's not enough,

147
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,440
I can also provide toilet service.

148
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:42,880
For free.

149
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:48,280
A Chinese person who doesn't speak Chinese properly.

150
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:49,610
Let's see you act tough.

151
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,660
You complained a lot on the phone,

152
00:07:01,840 --> 00:07:02,900
but you still came.

153
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,760
I don't have to pay rent here.

154
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,220
I'll work to pay it off.

155
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:09,820
In your dreams.

156
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:12,540
If it's not enough, you still have to pay.

157
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,560
Let me introduce you.

158
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,560
This is Zhang Yang.

159
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,120
His main job is as a photographer,

160
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,600
and he works part-time at the front desk.

161
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,200
This is my sister, Li Xinyue.

162
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,200
Hello.

163
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,840
You two will be colleagues from now on.

164
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:28,700
Get along well.

165
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,980
We can't get along at all, sister.

166
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:33,050
I still have something to tell you.

167
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:36,880
Hey.

168
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,200
Okay.

169
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,010
I don't accept bribes here.

170
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,500
And I definitely don't accept flattery.

171
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:08,880
Miss Li.

172
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:11,240
I offer you my sincerest apologies.

173
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,760
Let's add each other on WeChat.

174
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:14,090
I'll refund your money.

175
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:15,280
Let's just let this go.

176
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:17,740
Please don't complain to your sister, okay?

177
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,580
Three hundred.

178
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,440
I charged you three yuan,

179
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,440
and at least gave you a piece of paper.

180
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:26,040
You're asking for three hundred out of nowhere?

181
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:26,800
Sister.

182
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,080
Scan.

183
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:31,800
What's wrong?

184
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,320
Nothing.

185
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:34,960
After your divorce,

186
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,620
you've become even prettier.

187
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,130
When was I ever ugly?

188
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,000
Okay.

189
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:44,480
A family of four is coming soon.

190
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,560
You two go pick them up.

191
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,440
One drives,

192
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,880
one carries the luggage.

193
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:48,840
Okay.

194
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,600
Childish.

195
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:14,880
Coming.

196
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,200
That was fast.

197
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,880
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

198
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,080
You drove the car away

199
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,410
and left me to ride this.

200
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,880
You ride slow. Is that my fault?

201
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:25,800
We have a 300-yuan friendship

202
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:27,080
and you treat me like this?

203
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:29,040
Correction, 297 yuan.

204
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:31,520
Good luck moving the luggage later.

205
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,880
What 297?

206
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:35,720
That three yuan is a refund from you.

207
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:40,360
Li Xinyue.

208
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:42,600
Our destiny started

209
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:45,010
from the moment you squeezed your legs

210
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:47,640
and asked me for a tissue.

211
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,040
It was forged right then.

212
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:56,480
Are you sure it's destiny?

213
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,600
Of course.

214
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,600
This huge destiny

215
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,460
is almost like a curse.

216
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,240
You!

217
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,520
You must be Ms. Lin.

218
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,920
We're the B&B receptionists,

219
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,650
here to help with your luggage.

220
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,010
This one, right?

221
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:18,560
Um,

222
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,840
You booked for four guests, right?

223
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:23,240
The car might not fit five people.

224
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:23,760
Wait.

225
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,520
Does the kid count too?

226
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:26,680
Besides,

227
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,260
why did two of you come?

228
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,930
One would have been enough.

229
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:30,880
I'm sorry.

230
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,360
I can just take a taxi.

231
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,580
How about this?

232
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,440
Here are the car keys.

233
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:38,560
You can drive it back.

234
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:39,520
I'll send you the location later.

235
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:41,320
It's a 10-minute drive, not far.

236
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:42,800
Well...

237
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,440
I feel a bit bad.

238
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,000
Excuse me, let me drive.

239
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:47,320
Come on, hurry up.

240
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:47,960
I'm exhausted.

241
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:48,890
Let's get going.

242
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:50,880
All right.

243
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,320
Yiyi is a steady driver.

244
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,050
Don't worry.

245
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,170
We trust her.

246
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,040
As for my and my colleague's cab fare,

247
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:57,560
please settle it later.

248
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:01,080
Didn't you tell us to drive back?

249
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,520
Is your homestay

250
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:03,920
legitimate or not?

251
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,880
Of course it is.

252
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:08,320
You drive, and we take a cab.

253
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,480
There's no problem.

254
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:10,880
Kids,

255
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,600
didn't your teachers teach you that

256
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:14,660
there's no such thing as a free lunch?

257
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:15,680
I'm sorry.

258
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,960
We are not the type to take advantage.

259
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:19,840
What does taking advantage have to do with it?

260
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:22,160
It's obvious they didn't make clear arrangements.

261
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:22,560
Mom.

262
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:23,720
Let's not get angry.

263
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,360
It's fine.

264
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:25,840
I'm sorry.

265
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,320
There's no need to be sorry.

266
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,640
I think they are pretty shameless.

267
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:30,320
Watch your mouth,

268
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,000
little girl.

269
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:31,680
I'm sorry.

270
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:32,760
I'm sorry.

271
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:35,000
We didn't arrange things properly.

272
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:35,840
How about this.

273
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,880
I'll arrange five breakfast vouchers,

274
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:38,920
five room services,

275
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:39,920
five fruit platters,

276
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:40,560
and five...

277
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,680
Alright, let's leave it at that.

278
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:42,480
Listening to this gives me a headache.

279
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,800
Let's go, son. Get in the car.

280
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:44,160
I'm exhausted.

281
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:44,960
Get in the car.

282
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:45,610
That car.

283
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,400
Alright.

284
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:48,400
I'm sorry.

285
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:49,280
I'll pay you.

286
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:50,360
No need.

287
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,440
Thank you.

288
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,840
Thank you for just now.

289
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:01,240
It's no big deal.

290
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,560
By the way,

291
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,440
working together for the first time,

292
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:05,640
it feels pretty good.

293
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:07,120
Why don't we shake hands

294
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:07,980
and make peace?

295
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:10,920
Really?

296
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,720
Didn't you just say

297
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:16,000
I was your jinx?

298
00:12:16,160 --> 00:12:17,000
Ouch!

299
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,440
It's a good jinx.

300
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,200
A wonderful jinx.

301
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,130
A jinx that makes me laugh out loud.

302
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,220
Oyster omelet.

303
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:34,080
Try it.

304
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,720
There's an old saying in Nan'an.

305
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:38,580
A full stomach leaves no worries.

306
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:40,980
I won't buy it if it's over eight yuan.

307
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,640
I won't take

308
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,640
your money.

309
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:43,520
Eat it.

310
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:46,520
Thank you.

311
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:57,360
I guess

312
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:59,440
you're the kind of person who saves the best food

313
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,720
for last.

314
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:05,720
I guess

315
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,320
you're the kind of person

316
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:09,650
who thinks what you see is the whole world.

317
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:13,330
How long has it been since you came back, miss?

318
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,920
That's not the way home.

319
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,320
Are you that young

320
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,800
to call me miss?

321
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,840
Why are you in such a hurry?

322
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,240
I'm busy.

323
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,520
Busy with what?

324
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:28,360
Busy moving forward.

325
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,080
But this is Nan'an.

326
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:32,840
Look at all the pedestrians walking so slowly.

327
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,220
You should do the same.

328
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,920
This is the charm of Nan'an.

329
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,520
It's also why I stayed.

330
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,280
Welcome back to Nan'an,

331
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:43,720
bad-tempered miss.

332
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,200
Don't call me miss again.

333
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:50,240
Lou Chaocong.

334
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,040
So handsome he gets hacked.

335
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:54,040
Delivery is here.

336
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,720
My delivery is here!

337
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:23,520
What?

338
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,800
The first cup of milk tea in autumn.

339
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:26,800
Never heard of it.

340
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,200
Milk tea?

341
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:33,000
I thought you bought two buckets of eight-treasure porridge from somewhere.

342
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,600
Half price for the second cup.

343
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:36,480
The more toppings, the higher the unit price,

344
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,880
and the bigger the discount.

345
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:38,840
It's awesome!

346
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,460
It reminds me of a joke.

347
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:45,360
There was a drunkard,

348
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:46,840
and he accidentally,

349
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:47,840
with a heave,

350
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:50,200
puked into the porridge shop's plain porridge.

351
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,560
And the next morning,

352
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:53,160
when the boss opened the door,

353
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:54,680
oh my god,

354
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:57,440
the customers gave him a thumbs up and said...

355
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:58,760
Said what?

356
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:00,760
They said, 'Boss,

357
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:04,400
this eight-treasure porridge is awesome!'

358
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,300
We have nothing in common.

359
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:13,480
Hello.

360
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:15,880
How can I help you?

361
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:16,840
Excuse me.

362
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,720
I'll be heading back tomorrow.

363
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:21,880
My partner asked me to buy some dried seafood to take home,

364
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,800
but I don't know how to pick the good ones.

365
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:25,720
If you guys have time,

366
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:27,120
could you come with me to pick out some goods

367
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,320
and haggle over the price?

368
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,040
I won't ask you to help for free.

369
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,500
I'll pay for your trouble.

370
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:32,560
I'm sorry, miss,

371
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:34,240
but we're working right now.

372
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:35,960
If we leave our post without permission, we'll be...

373
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,440
Of course we can.

374
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,280
The money isn't important.

375
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:42,940
I mainly just want to show you some hospitality.

376
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,480
Please wait for me at the door.

377
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,480
Give me a moment to pack up, and I'll meet you there.

378
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:48,410
Thank you. I'll go wait at the door.

379
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:49,200
Okay.

380
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:55,960
Hospitality?

381
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,160
Landlords in modern history

382
00:15:58,160 --> 00:15:59,420
didn't have a good end.

383
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:02,520
There are few people in the shop now,

384
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:04,180
and we're close to the market.

385
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:06,280
You can just cover for me.

386
00:16:06,520 --> 00:16:07,680
As for the payment,

387
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,680
how about a 90-10 split?

388
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:12,080
Your room and board here,

389
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:13,410
how much is it per month?

390
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:16,320
About four or five thousand.

391
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,640
Let's say 5,000.

392
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:20,560
You work 22 days a month,

393
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:22,400
for eight hours a day.

394
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,200
On average, your hourly wage

395
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:25,200
is 28.4 yuan.

396
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:26,480
My hourly rate for covering for you

397
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:28,120
will be calculated at 28.4 yuan.

398
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,920
Which one of us is the profiteer?

399
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,640
Watch your words.

400
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:35,320
My charging standards are fair, just, and open.

401
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:37,200
Unlike some profiteers

402
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:39,520
who try every trick to take money from clients' pockets.

403
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:40,960
There is a fundamental difference.

404
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:41,680
Okay.

405
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,140
I'll make it quick.

406
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,400
Don't even think about drinking my eight-treasure congee.
